@baseUrl = http://localhost:5054

### The profile in the default locale (Russian)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile

### The profile in English
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile?locale=en

### An unsupported locale — 400, with the list of supported locales
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile?locale=de

### The published projects, in the default locale
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects

### The published projects in English
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects?locale=en

### Liveness: the process is up
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness: unhealthy until the database answers
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
